# SCAL-COVER: every quality row moves the picture or the cost (Scalability.json v4): draw distance, landscape grid
# error, foliage instance density, cloud rows. The Bistro half is SCAL-COVER-BISTRO.scn.
# Conditions: PC unlocked, display on, VRAM below budget, machine.json without overrides; 300 frames before a dump.
# [vuid] editor.log has 0 VUID. [machine] machine.json is byte-identical after the run; a machine recommended by the
# v3 data is re-measured once on its next ordinary start and is not recommended Cinematic.
# BEFORE = the same shot on the dev tip before SCAL-COVER, put on the left of the side-by-side.
Проект Projects/Desert/Desert.deproj --scene Content/Scenes/FIELD_Barn.desce --gpu-profile
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position 0,170,2500
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0.15,-0.03,-1
Дано set 8180000000000004 WindSourceData.Speed 0
